### European Union: Software Directive 2009/24/EC\
\
Under Article 6, certain decompilation activities are permitted when necessary to make independently developed software interoperable with other programs.\
\
The permission has conditions: the information must not already be readily available, and the decompilation must be limited to what's necessary for interoperability.\
